WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.788
The girls headed toward a large, open structure.

2
00:00:06.789 --> 00:00:12.116
It was one of seven buildings that made up Nyoman’s family’s home.

3
00:00:12.117 --> 00:00:16.336
"Now we can prepare the offerings," said Nyoman.

4
00:00:16.337 --> 00:00:20.255
"What offerings?" asked Mandy.

5
00:00:20.256 --> 00:00:23.601
"To give to the temple," she explained.

6
00:00:23.602 --> 00:00:28.822
Nyoman held up some coconut leaves and different kinds of flowers.

7
00:00:28.823 --> 00:00:31.693
"I will show you how to make it."

8
00:00:31.694 --> 00:00:38.409
Meanwhile the boys were running down the mountain.

9
00:00:38.410 --> 00:00:43.458
"I think the rumbling stopped," gasped Vinnie, out of breath.

10
00:00:43.459 --> 00:00:48.442
When they finally reached the village, the mountain was quiet again.

11
00:00:48.443 --> 00:00:53.717
In fact, no one in the village seemed to know that the ground had shook.

12
00:00:53.718 --> 00:00:58.566
They were all getting ready for the Iron Fence festival.

13
00:00:58.567 --> 00:01:02.773
"That mountain is a volcano," said Wayan.

14
00:01:02.774 --> 00:01:07.306
"According to our ancestors, it has erupted several times.

15
00:01:07.307 --> 00:01:10.561
Who knows when it will happen again?"

16
00:01:10.562 --> 00:01:15.567
"Well, I’m glad it didn’t erupt today!" cried Vinnie.

17
00:01:15.568 --> 00:01:21.026
Meanwhile Nyoman and Mandy finished making three offerings.

18
00:01:21.027 --> 00:01:25.541
Then Nyoman wove some flowers through a bamboo comb.

19
00:01:25.542 --> 00:01:28.313
She put it on her head.

20
00:01:28.314 --> 00:01:32.373
"That looks so pretty," remarked Mandy.

21
00:01:32.374 --> 00:01:39.040
"I will make you one too, Mandy," said Nyoman, "since we will be going to the temple."

22
00:01:39.041 --> 00:01:43.001
"Oh, thank you!" said Mandy.

23
00:01:43.002 --> 00:01:47.955
Nyoman began to weave flowers into a comb for Mandy.

24
00:01:47.956 --> 00:01:51.455
"Why is it called the Iron Fence festival?"

25
00:01:51.456 --> 00:01:56.349
Mandy asked as Nyoman put the comb in Mandy’s hair.

26
00:01:56.350 --> 00:02:01.120
"It is a time when we imagine an iron fence around our minds.

27
00:02:01.121 --> 00:02:05.278
The fence protects us from evil spirits and bad thoughts.

28
00:02:05.279 --> 00:02:10.012
We try to think only good thoughts so we can be better people.

29
00:02:10.013 --> 00:02:15.075
We celebrate by making offerings at the temple, like these.

30
00:02:15.076 --> 00:02:19.436
There will be music and a special dance too!" she added.

31
00:02:19.437 --> 00:02:24.512
"That’s so interesting!" Mandy said.

32
00:02:24.513 --> 00:02:27.533
"You look wonderful, Mandy!" said Nyoman.

33
00:02:27.534 --> 00:02:31.395
"Now let’s go see the dance."

34
00:02:31.396 --> 00:02:36.982
The girls went to meet Nyoman’s parents in the center of the village.

35
00:02:36.983 --> 00:02:42.829
The area was already filling up with people who wanted to see the performance.

36
00:02:42.830 --> 00:02:47.118
Everyone was smiling and looked happy.

37
00:02:47.119 --> 00:02:49.306
"The dance is about to begin!"

38
00:02:49.307 --> 00:02:53.863
cried Nyoman as she led Mandy close to the stage.

39
00:02:53.864 --> 00:02:57.463
"Who are those men?" asked Mandy.

40
00:02:57.464 --> 00:03:02.068
A large group of musicians were sitting on the ground.

41
00:03:02.069 --> 00:03:05.314
Some of them had drums and gongs.

42
00:03:05.315 --> 00:03:09.390
Mandy did not recognize the other instruments.

43
00:03:09.391 --> 00:03:12.957
"That’s the band," explained Nyoman.

44
00:03:12.958 --> 00:03:16.306
"They will play music for the dance."

45
00:03:16.307 --> 00:03:19.690
One of the musicians began to beat a drum.

46
00:03:19.691 --> 00:03:22.677
Soon the others joined in.

47
00:03:22.678 --> 00:03:25.814
Mandy liked the music a lot.

48
00:03:25.815 --> 00:03:35.704
"I wish Vinnie could hear this," she thought to herself.

